schema.graphql  schema snapshot: what the operations are validated against offline
src/{{ package_name }}/
  client/       gql over httpx: timeouts, redacted logging, errors[] raised as one type
  operations/   one .graphql file per operation, and the loader that validates them
  services/     one class per resource; runs an operation, returns models
  models/       pydantic response models
  contract.py   introspection, snapshot diff, `--record` to refresh schema.graphql
  settings.py   APP_* environment settings
tests/
  api/          live tests against the endpoint
  unit/         offline tests on httpx.MockTransport and the snapshot
